# turbofit-memory-monitor
owner: senter-wiki-bot · cadence: every 30s · status: SUGGESTED
**Want me to watch for memory overcommit and automatically log when KV cache usage approaches the 32GB limit?**

## Prompt
Monitor system memory and MTPLX/KV cache usage. When total process memory exceeds 24GB or KV cache projected size exceeds 6GB, append to wiki/entities/turbofit-memory-crash.md with timestamp, memory readings, and context size. Trigger alert if OOM risk detected.

## Evidence
> Memory plan shows `OVERCOMMITTED` before process kills
> KV at full 131K window needs 8.0 GiB
> Background processes exited with code -9 under memory pressure
